# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Allowlist-by-extension.
#
# Everything is ignored first, then only sources, docs and raw logs are
# un-ignored. Rationale: this tree accumulated 39 extensionless aarch64 ELF
# binaries and 55 .spv blobs. A denylist of binary names goes stale the moment
# a new round adds `vkopt10`; an allowlist cannot leak a binary by omission.
#
# Consequence to be aware of: a NEW file type is ignored until it is added
# below. If a file is missing from `git ls-files`, check this list first.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*
!*/

# --- sources ---------------------------------------------------------------
!*.c
!*.h
!*.S
!*.s
!*.comp
!*.py
!*.sh
!Makefile

# --- docs ------------------------------------------------------------------
!*.md
!LICENSE
!README*
!.gitignore

# --- evidence: raw logs, captured output, SPIR-V stat dumps -----------------
!*.txt
!*.out
!*.json

# --- explicitly NOT tracked (stated here so the intent is reviewable) ------
# *.spv   compiled SPIR-V; regenerate with glslangValidator from *.comp
# *.bin   OpenCL program binaries emitted by oclbin; regenerate by running it
# *.264   third-party H.264 test vector with unclear licensing
# no-ext  built aarch64 binaries

# --- local scratch ---------------------------------------------------------
*.o
*.so
*.a
*.d
core
core.*
.env
*.key
*.pem
bench.bin
disk.bin
